% Inclusio diagram page — the keeping words that frame the letter
\thispagestyle{empty}
\begin{center}
\vspace*{0.5cm}
{\Large\bfseries\color{ChapterPurple} 「保守」的包夾}\\[0.1cm]
{\normalsize The Frame of Keeping}

\vspace{0.6cm}

\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=0.9]
  % Outer frame: God keeps (v.1) ... God is able to keep (v.24)
  \draw[ChapterPurple,line width=1.6pt,rounded corners] (-5.6,-4.2) rectangle (5.6,3.6);
  \node[font=\small\bfseries,text=ChapterPurple] at (0,3.1) {v.1 \ 為耶穌基督保守的人 \ \textit{kept for Jesus Christ}};
  \node[font=\small\bfseries,text=ChapterPurple] at (0,-3.7) {v.24 \ 那能保守你們不失腳的 \ \textit{able to keep you}};

  % Inner: those who did not keep, kept for judgment
  \draw[ScriptureGold,line width=0.8pt,rounded corners,dashed] (-4.9,-0.4) rectangle (4.9,2.4);
  \node[font=\footnotesize,text=CommentaryBrown,align=center] at (0,1.75) {v.6 \ 不守本位的天使——主用鎖鍊把他們永遠拘留};
  \node[font=\footnotesize,text=CommentaryBrown,align=center] at (0,1.05) {\textit{did not keep} \ldots\ \textit{He has kept} in eternal bonds};
  \node[font=\footnotesize,text=CommentaryBrown,align=center] at (0,0.3) {v.13 \ 有墨黑的幽暗為他們永遠存留 \ \textit{reserved forever}};

  % Center of the believer's response
  \node[draw=ScriptureGold,fill=ScriptureBg,rounded corners,font=\small\bfseries,text=ChapterPurple,align=center] at (0,-1.9) {v.21 \ 保守自己常在神的愛中\\\textit{keep yourselves in the love of God}};
\end{tikzpicture}

\vspace{0.8cm}

\begin{minipage}{4.6in}
\small\color{TextGray}
猶大書用同一個動詞 τηρέω（保守、拘留、存留）把全信框起來：開頭說信徒「蒙保守」，中間說不守本位的被「拘留」、被「存留」受審判，末了吩咐信徒「保守自己」——而最後一句話，交給「那能保守你們不失腳的」（v.24，另一個動詞 φυλάσσω）。警告寫在保守裏面；讀者站在神的保守之內，聽神的警告。
\end{minipage}

\vspace{0.5cm}
{\footnotesize\color{LightGray} 「保守自己常在神的愛中。」— 猶大書 21}
\end{center}
