{\Large\itshape\color{CoverGoldBright} τετηρημένοις — τηρήσατε — φυλάξαι}\\[0.1cm]
{\itshape\small\color{CoverMuted} {\baskervillefont "Kept — keep yourselves — able to keep"} · 全信的三個「保守」(1, 21, 24)}

\vspace{0.4cm}

\fleuron[CoverGoldBright]\hspace{0.25cm}{\color{CoverGoldBright}\rule{1.8in}{0.4pt}}\hspace{0.25cm}\fleuron[CoverGoldBright]

\vspace{0.4cm}

{\large\bfseries\color{CoverCream} 關於本書}\qquad{\baskervillefont\itshape\large\color{CoverGoldBright} About This Book}

\vspace{0.4cm}

\begin{minipage}{5in}
\small\color{CoverCream}
猶大書只有二十五節，卻是一封夾在兩個「保守」中間的警告信：開頭說信徒是「為耶穌基督保守的人」，結尾把一切交給「那能保守你們不失腳的」。本書分五段逐節研讀全信，以「啟示的次序」為骨幹，整合老弟兄的查經方法、亞歷山大的革利免與加爾文的歷代注疏、G. Campbell Morgan 的解經，以及 John MacArthur 的逐節講道（gty.org）。每一句歸給注疏家的引文都附英文原文與出處，可以按圖索驥核對。

\vspace{0.3cm}

{\baskervillefont\color{CoverCream}\lettrine[lines=3,findent=2pt,nindent=2pt]{\color{CoverGoldBright}J}{}ude is twenty-five verses long, and every warning in it stands inside two words of keeping: the readers are “kept for Jesus Christ” at the start, and committed at the end “to Him who is able to keep you from stumbling.” This study reads the whole letter in five movements, built on the order of revelation, with Elder Wong's way of reading Scripture, the commentary of Clement of Alexandria and John Calvin, G. Campbell Morgan's exposition, and John MacArthur's verse-by-verse preaching (gty.org). Every quotation attributed to a commentator is given in its original English with a source a reader can check.}
\end{minipage}

\vspace{0.4cm}

{\small\bfseries\color{CoverCream} 五步：從蒙保守到被呈獻}\qquad{\baskervillefont\itshape\small\color{CoverGoldBright} Five Movements}

\vspace{0.3cm}

\begin{minipage}{4.7in}
\small\color{CoverCream}
\begin{tabular}{@{}cp{3.4in}l@{}}
第一步 & 蒙保守的人被呼召爭辯 \textit{\baskervillefont\color{CoverCream} The kept are called to contend} & {\tiny\color{CoverMuted} 1-4}\\[0.25em]
第二步 & 神已經在歷史中審判 \textit{\baskervillefont\color{CoverCream} God has judged in history} & {\tiny\color{CoverMuted} 5-7}\\[0.25em]
第三步 & 主必帶千萬聖者降臨 \textit{\baskervillefont\color{CoverCream} The Lord comes to judge} & {\tiny\color{CoverMuted} 8-16}\\[0.25em]
第四步 & 你們卻要保守自己 \textit{\baskervillefont\color{CoverCream} But you, keep yourselves} & {\tiny\color{CoverMuted} 17-23}\\[0.25em]
第五步 & 那能保守你們的 \textit{\baskervillefont\color{CoverCream} To Him who is able to keep} & {\tiny\color{CoverMuted} 24-25}\\
\end{tabular}
\end{minipage}

